.*
# `.*` above also excludes the directory itself, and git cannot re-include a
# file whose parent directory is excluded. Re-include the ones we track first,
# or the nested `!` rules below never take effect.
!/.github/
!/.vscode/

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
/target/
dist-ssr
*.local
.env


